Package: kodexbar-suite
Version: @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Karasowl <96896642+Karasowl@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: bash, python3 (>= 3.10)
Suggests: plasma-workspace, konsole, python3-gi, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, wl-clipboard, xclip, xsel
Homepage: https://github.com/Karasowl/KodexBar-Suite
Description: Linux AI quota monitor and KDE Plasma 6 widget
 KodexBar Suite provides native quota tools for AI coding assistants,
 panel and tray integrations, local model monitoring, skill inventory,
 and an optional KDE Plasma 6 widget.
